# Docs in this directory are synced verbatim with legion-voice-mixer:docs/voice/, and the
# sync convention verifies BLOB hashes (git rev-parse HEAD:<path>) on both sides. Pin LF so
# fresh checkouts of both repos materialise byte-identical files (the mixer pins eol=lf
# repo-wide). This directory is Legion-authored and absent upstream, so this file cannot
# conflict on a rebase.
* text eol=lf
